constexpr int isqrt(int x)
{
return isqrt_helper(1,3,x)/2 − 1;
}
constexpr int s1 = isqrt(9); 
// s1 becomes 3
constexpr int s2 = isqrt(1234);
The condition of a ?: is evaluated and then the selected alternative is evaluated.

